338
00:23:03,720 --> 00:23:04,759
They'd think it's a scam.

339
00:23:06,799 --> 00:23:07,519
Tomato rice bowl.

340
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:08,079
Alright.

341
00:23:08,119 --> 00:23:09,480
Get me one of those too,

342
00:23:10,759 --> 00:23:12,119
and bring two sodas.

343
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:12,920
Coming right up!

344
00:23:18,319 --> 00:23:19,200
You look pretty young.

345
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:20,240
Just graduated from college?

346
00:23:20,839 --> 00:23:21,359
Just graduated.

347
00:23:21,759 --> 00:23:22,799
They're that big?

348
00:23:22,920 --> 00:23:23,920
Just one bottle is fine.

349
00:23:25,119 --> 00:23:25,680
Thank you, sir.

350
00:23:28,799 --> 00:23:30,599
Here, have a glass too.

351
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:31,440
Sure.

352
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:32,240
No worries, no worries.

353
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:33,359
Have some.

354
00:23:34,119 --> 00:23:34,640
Thanks, brother.

355
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:35,000
Don't mention it.

356
00:23:35,519 --> 00:23:36,039
Drink up.

357
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:36,960
Quenches the thirst.

358
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:40,039
Where do you work?

359
00:23:40,960 --> 00:23:42,200
Right next door at the service branch.

360
00:23:44,240 --> 00:23:45,559
Must make good money there.

361
00:23:45,960 --> 00:23:46,759
Just base pay, really.

362
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:47,920
Barely enough to get by.

363
00:23:48,480 --> 00:23:49,440
We mostly rely on commission.

364
00:23:52,200 --> 00:23:52,799
Thank you.

365
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:54,359
Thanks.

366
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:55,640
Thanks, thank you.

367
00:23:56,319 --> 00:23:57,359
You're eating pretty light, huh?

368
00:23:57,880 --> 00:23:58,240
Well...

369
00:23:58,359 --> 00:23:58,799
It's cheap.

370
00:23:59,000 --> 00:23:59,480
And it tastes good.

371
00:23:59,880 --> 00:24:00,480
Is that so?

372
00:24:01,079 --> 00:24:02,160
No wonder you're so thin.

373
00:24:04,079 --> 00:24:04,799
Well, you're young.

374
00:24:04,960 --> 00:24:06,319
Nothing wrong with roughing it a bit now.

375
00:24:07,839 --> 00:24:08,759
It gains you some experience.

376
00:24:09,079 --> 00:24:10,200
Makes everything easier down the road.

377
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:16,839
Are you a Lacheng local?

378
00:24:17,799 --> 00:24:18,440
More or less.

379
00:24:19,839 --> 00:24:22,079
Then your parents are old-timers at Lapi Brewery?

380
00:24:24,319 --> 00:24:25,240
They used to be.

381
00:24:28,359 --> 00:24:29,200
How old are they?

382
00:24:31,839 --> 00:24:32,680
About your age.

383
00:24:34,240 --> 00:24:35,079
How old am I?

384
00:24:37,319 --> 00:24:38,079
In your fifties.

385
00:24:45,799 --> 00:24:46,799
You guessed too high.

386
00:24:47,079 --> 00:24:47,519
No.

387
00:24:49,720 --> 00:24:50,119
I'm

388
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,240
only 52.

389
00:24:55,279 --> 00:24:57,559
Are your parents still at Lapi Brewery?

390
00:24:59,799 --> 00:25:00,759
Right now...

391
00:25:05,480 --> 00:25:06,920
Right now...

392
00:25:07,559 --> 00:25:09,400
our telecom store

393
00:25:10,319 --> 00:25:11,279
has a new promo.

394
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:13,240
Broadband,

395
00:25:13,519 --> 00:25:14,240
300 megs.

396
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:15,400
Crazy fast.

397
00:25:16,119 --> 00:25:17,559
Whether you're grinding games

398
00:25:17,599 --> 00:25:18,359
or watching videos,

399
00:25:18,839 --> 00:25:20,319
the speed is rock-solid.

400
00:25:20,839 --> 00:25:22,000
Why not check it out?

401
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:25,240
I just had it installed a few days ago.

402
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:26,920
If I'd met you earlier,

403
00:25:26,920 --> 00:25:28,000
I would've gone with yours.

404
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:32,200
It's fine if you just got it.

405
00:25:32,519 --> 00:25:33,880
If you have friends or family,

406
00:25:34,000 --> 00:25:34,559
just have them contact me.

407
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:36,000
My name and number

408
00:25:36,079 --> 00:25:36,559
are right here.

409
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:38,720
I'll set everything up for them.

410
00:25:42,960 --> 00:25:43,599
Liu Xiaosheng.

411
00:25:43,680 --> 00:25:44,000
Right?

412
00:25:45,039 --> 00:25:46,200
You can just call me Xiao Liu.

413
00:25:50,519 --> 00:25:52,000
You're clearly a good kid.

414
00:25:57,480 --> 00:25:57,920
Server!

415
00:26:04,680 --> 00:26:05,000
Bro...

416
00:26:05,240 --> 00:26:05,920
Come on.

417
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:07,519
I'm about your parents' age.

418
00:26:07,559 --> 00:26:08,319
Treating you to a meal is nothing.

419
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:09,440
Besides, you helped me up earlier.

420
00:26:09,480 --> 00:26:10,119
I feel bad about this.

421
00:26:10,160 --> 00:26:10,599
Don't worry about it.

422
00:26:10,640 --> 00:26:11,480
Nothing to feel bad about. Tell you what,

423
00:26:11,839 --> 00:26:12,920
if you need anything later on,

424
00:26:12,960 --> 00:26:13,799
come find me at the store.

425
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:14,599
I'll give you a discount.

426
00:26:14,839 --> 00:26:15,279
Sounds good.

427
00:26:15,319 --> 00:26:15,680
Great.

428
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:18,680
Great.

429
00:26:19,200 --> 00:26:20,160
Thanks, bro.

430
00:26:20,559 --> 00:26:21,160
Why call me "bro"?

431
00:26:21,200 --> 00:26:21,920
Call me Uncle.

432
00:26:22,319 --> 00:26:23,960
I'm about your dad's age.

433
00:26:24,160 --> 00:26:24,680
Call me Uncle.

434
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:27,400
Thanks, Uncle.

435
00:26:28,000 --> 00:26:28,279
That's it.

436
00:26:35,559 --> 00:26:36,119
Here,

437
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:38,000
my number.

438
00:26:38,640 --> 00:26:39,519
If anything comes up,

439
00:26:39,799 --> 00:26:40,400
feel free to call me.

440
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:41,640
You got it.

441
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:42,799
Not just about work,

442
00:26:42,920 --> 00:26:44,079
personal matters too.

443
00:26:47,680 --> 00:26:48,079
All right, then.

444
00:26:48,319 --> 00:26:49,359
I'll take off now.

445
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:50,160
Should I...

446
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:51,079
No, no, don't get up.

447
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:52,279
Stay and eat.

448
00:26:52,720 --> 00:26:53,680
I'm taking this with me.

449
00:26:53,799 --> 00:26:54,440
Sure thing.

450
00:27:45,799 --> 00:27:46,279
Gao,

451
00:27:47,359 --> 00:27:48,000
take

452
00:27:48,559 --> 00:27:49,880
the bottle caps found

453
00:27:49,920 --> 00:27:51,160
on the three victims,

454
00:27:51,799 --> 00:27:52,279
photograph them,

455
00:27:52,359 --> 00:27:53,400
and send them all to me.

456
00:27:54,920 --> 00:27:55,680
All right, don't worry about it.

457
00:27:56,119 --> 00:27:56,559
I have a use for them.

458
00:28:17,480 --> 00:28:18,039
Bro.

459
00:28:19,319 --> 00:28:19,960
Bro, it's Xiao Guo.

460
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:20,359
I was just...

461
00:28:20,400 --> 00:28:21,200
I-I won't run anymore.

462
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:21,599
Okay?

463
00:28:21,599 --> 00:28:22,119
Wait...

464
00:28:22,720 --> 00:28:23,319
So you're here.

465
00:28:23,319 --> 00:28:24,359
I was just heading down to meet you.

466
00:28:24,559 --> 00:28:25,440
Where did you go again?

467
00:28:25,720 --> 00:28:26,319
I went down to look for...

468
00:28:27,119 --> 00:28:27,440
my notebook.

469
00:28:27,799 --> 00:28:28,160
All right.

470
00:28:29,319 --> 00:28:29,680
Bro,

471
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:32,559
you asked me for those three bottle caps today.

472
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:33,759
Did you find something?

473
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:34,839
Yeah.

474
00:28:35,400 --> 00:28:36,240
What did you find?

475
00:28:36,319 --> 00:28:37,000
I...

476
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:38,079
I found out that...

477
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:39,640
you're pretty sharp.

478
00:28:40,880 --> 00:28:42,240
Bro, stop messing around.

479
00:28:43,400 --> 00:28:44,200
Here, take a look.

480
00:28:44,480 --> 00:28:45,720
These are the three bottle caps you sent me.

481
00:28:46,599 --> 00:28:47,160
Look.

482
00:28:47,640 --> 00:28:48,599
Notice anything different?

483
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:50,279
The designs are different.

484
00:28:50,319 --> 00:28:51,519
I noticed that when I sent them.

485
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:54,839
Take another look at this.

486
00:29:02,880 --> 00:29:04,400
You mean not only is the style different,

487
00:29:05,160 --> 00:29:07,039
but the bottle cap in Cao Jun's case

488
00:29:07,359 --> 00:29:07,920
was pried open before

489
00:29:08,279 --> 00:29:08,880
and used?

490
00:29:09,720 --> 00:29:11,279
That's why you're the smart one.

491
00:29:12,519 --> 00:29:14,039
Ma Guowen had dozens of

492
00:29:14,039 --> 00:29:16,000
commemorative bottle caps framed on his wall,

493
00:29:16,240 --> 00:29:17,599
but none were found at the scene.

494
00:29:18,039 --> 00:29:20,039
The killer most likely took them.

495
00:29:20,279 --> 00:29:21,960
If the killer had those commemorative caps,

496
00:29:21,960 --> 00:29:22,680
he should've used one of those

497
00:29:22,680 --> 00:29:23,680
instead of suddenly switching styles

498
00:29:23,960 --> 00:29:24,720
and ruining the ritual.

499
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:25,400
Exactly.

500
00:29:27,279 --> 00:29:28,400
So we've been

501
00:29:28,400 --> 00:29:30,039
heading down the wrong path this whole time.

502
00:29:30,039 --> 00:29:31,440
There's more than one killer.

503
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:35,880
But we screened everyone we had to.

504
00:29:36,200 --> 00:29:36,960
Everyone from the brewery,

505
00:29:37,680 --> 00:29:39,319
especially those involved in the auction back then.

506
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:40,759
None of them turned out

507
00:29:40,759 --> 00:29:42,200
to have that commemorative cap.

508
00:29:42,599 --> 00:29:43,680
Come on, do you really think

509
00:29:43,680 --> 00:29:45,599
if the killer wanted to use it in the crime,

510
00:29:45,599 --> 00:29:46,880
he'd let you find it that easily?

511
00:29:49,000 --> 00:29:49,920
In Cao Jun's case,

512
00:29:50,440 --> 00:29:52,279
our primary suspects

513
00:29:52,279 --> 00:29:53,799
all have alibis.

514
00:29:54,279 --> 00:29:56,000
But if what we just deduced holds,

515
00:29:57,079 --> 00:29:59,079
that Cao Jun's killer and Ma Guowen's killer

516
00:29:59,079 --> 00:29:59,839
aren't the same person,

517
00:30:01,160 --> 00:30:02,039
then all the leads

518
00:30:02,319 --> 00:30:03,759
we investigated have to be thrown out.

519
00:30:10,640 --> 00:30:11,759
There's definitely more than one killer.

520
00:30:16,559 --> 00:30:17,279
Cao Jun...

521
00:30:18,519 --> 00:30:19,920
The traitor mentioned in the diary

522
00:30:21,519 --> 00:30:22,400
is Chen Qingchun.

523
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:27,000
His son Chen Yuan stole the tape.

524
00:30:27,839 --> 00:30:29,000
He claimed he did it for Liu Xuemei,

525
00:30:29,640 --> 00:30:30,519
but when he returned it,

526
00:30:30,519 --> 00:30:32,279
half of the tape had been erased.

527
00:30:32,440 --> 00:30:34,079
That footage was about Chen Qingchun.

528
00:30:34,799 --> 00:30:36,359
Back during the brewery's auction,

529
00:30:36,359 --> 00:30:37,599
everyone was locked inside the plant.

530
00:30:37,720 --> 00:30:38,000
Right.

531
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:40,480
The security guard gave the key to Chen Qingchun.

532
00:30:40,599 --> 00:30:42,480
Chen Yuan didn't do it by accident at all.

533
00:30:42,519 --> 00:30:43,799
He was covering for his dad.

534
00:30:45,880 --> 00:30:47,200
So Cao Jun

535
00:30:47,240 --> 00:30:48,359
was silenced.

536
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:50,279
Cao Jun knew the traitor was Chen Qingchun.

537
00:30:50,400 --> 00:30:51,680
He must've blackmailed him.

538
00:30:51,799 --> 00:30:53,200
Chen Qingchun panicked and wanted him dead,

539
00:30:53,680 --> 00:30:54,920
so he copied the earlier case.

540
00:30:55,039 --> 00:30:55,720
The beer bottle cap,

541
00:30:55,720 --> 00:30:56,119
the plastic bag,

542
00:30:56,119 --> 00:30:56,839
every single detail was there.

543
00:30:56,920 --> 00:30:58,920
His goal was to pin Cao Jun's death

544
00:30:59,000 --> 00:31:00,799
on the killer in Ma Guowen's case.

545
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:01,480
Am I right?

546
00:31:01,519 --> 00:31:03,400
So Chen Qingchun killed Cao Jun.

547
00:31:03,680 --> 00:31:04,279
Exactly.

548
00:31:04,799 --> 00:31:05,720
The logic tracks, right?

549
00:31:06,039 --> 00:31:06,480
Right.

550
00:31:07,440 --> 00:31:07,960
Right.

551
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:10,319
Wait, no.

552
00:31:10,799 --> 00:31:12,400
Chen Qingchun has an alibi.

553
00:31:12,799 --> 00:31:13,839
The night Cao Jun died,

554
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:15,279
he crashed into the sculpture at the plant.

555
00:31:15,559 --> 00:31:16,119
He wasn't at the scene.

556
00:31:16,160 --> 00:31:16,839
Right?

557
00:31:21,720 --> 00:31:22,160
Wait, didn't you

558
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:22,920
just say earlier

559
00:31:22,920 --> 00:31:24,519
that we're throwing out all previous theories?

560
00:31:25,799 --> 00:31:26,440
Did I say that?

561
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:28,000
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

562
00:31:28,039 --> 00:31:28,720
I said that.

563
00:31:28,799 --> 00:31:29,400
Right.

564
00:31:30,559 --> 00:31:31,000
Right.

565
00:31:31,759 --> 00:31:32,759
You did say it.

566
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:00,799
Dad...

567
00:32:02,480 --> 00:32:04,519
Just how many terrible things did you do?

568
00:32:05,519 --> 00:32:07,559
The traitor they've been looking for all this time,

569
00:32:08,480 --> 00:32:10,720
the one who sold out the workers back then...

570
00:32:12,160 --> 00:32:12,920
was you.

571
00:32:24,559 --> 00:32:26,079
From Shen Leshui's tape,

572
00:32:26,640 --> 00:32:27,640
everything about you,

573
00:32:28,880 --> 00:32:29,920
I wiped it all clean.

574
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:33,400
No one will ever know.

575
00:33:10,039 --> 00:33:10,680
So

576
00:33:14,079 --> 00:33:15,279
what did the police say?

577
00:33:18,480 --> 00:33:19,519
I just said

578
00:33:20,039 --> 00:33:21,680
I wiped it by accident,

579
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:25,640
and that I had no idea what was on it.

580
00:33:44,279 --> 00:33:45,599
Back then,

581
00:33:46,799 --> 00:33:48,799
Ma Guowen forced me into it, too.

582
00:33:58,599 --> 00:34:00,359
No one will ever find out now.

583
00:34:02,160 --> 00:34:03,599
Just put your mind at ease.

584
00:34:23,320 --> 00:34:24,559
The way I see it,

585
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:26,880
after tomorrow's auction,

586
00:34:27,119 --> 00:34:28,519
we'll become Lapi Brewery's

587
00:34:28,599 --> 00:34:30,159
true partners!

588
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:31,639
Great!

589
00:34:32,159 --> 00:34:33,880
Let's all pull together

590
00:34:34,280 --> 00:34:35,960
and make Lapi Brewery thrive.

591
00:34:36,199 --> 00:34:37,400
You bet! Great!

592
00:34:37,559 --> 00:34:39,320
And as for the technical side,

593
00:34:39,679 --> 00:34:41,400
I'll make sure our quality stays top-notch.

594
00:34:42,440 --> 00:34:42,880
Come on,

595
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:45,840
let's welcome the new millennium together

596
00:34:46,039 --> 00:34:48,599
and usher in a new spring for Lapi Brewery!

597
00:35:38,119 --> 00:35:39,719
What show do you want to watch?

598
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:41,400
The TV's messed up,

599
00:35:41,920 --> 00:35:43,280
and your eyes are going bad.

600
00:35:44,599 --> 00:35:45,679
Take your father-in-law.

601
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:48,480
Nobody puts on a show like him.

602
00:35:55,760 --> 00:35:56,719
You, too.

603
00:35:57,280 --> 00:35:58,599
Why do you keep running over here?

604
00:35:59,840 --> 00:36:01,360
I came to cook for you.

605
00:36:02,079 --> 00:36:03,159
Is checking on you a crime now?

606
00:36:03,719 --> 00:36:04,440
I'm not hungry.

607
00:36:06,320 --> 00:36:07,639
Just seeing Chen Qingchun

608
00:36:07,880 --> 00:36:08,880
makes my blood boil.

609
00:36:16,559 --> 00:36:18,760
He said he wants to transfer you and Chen Yuan away.

610
00:36:18,760 --> 00:36:19,440
What's that all about?

611
00:36:21,519 --> 00:36:22,719
The way I see it, that man...

612
00:36:22,719 --> 00:36:24,400
is really regressing with age.

613
00:36:25,079 --> 00:36:26,440
Always doing things on a whim.

614
00:36:27,599 --> 00:36:28,199
In the past,

615
00:36:28,199 --> 00:36:29,599
at least he had a clear head.

616
00:36:29,840 --> 00:36:30,360
And now?

617
00:36:30,360 --> 00:36:31,159
He's gotten older,

618
00:36:31,320 --> 00:36:32,440
and more muddled by the day.

619
00:36:32,760 --> 00:36:34,280
He even tried to fob me off with cheap tea dust.

620
00:36:34,280 --> 00:36:34,760
Can you believe that?

621
00:36:35,480 --> 00:36:37,519
He's an engineer, an intellectual, after all.

622
00:36:37,599 --> 00:36:38,679
Look at the way he handles things.

623
00:36:40,519 --> 00:36:41,440
Come on, that's enough.

624
00:36:42,519 --> 00:36:43,880
Chen Yuan's dad must feel

625
00:36:44,480 --> 00:36:45,760
that with his son having a criminal record,

626
00:36:45,800 --> 00:36:47,039
it's hard for him to stay here.

627
00:36:48,960 --> 00:36:50,559
He thinks transferring us all away,

628
00:36:51,119 --> 00:36:51,880
getting out of here,

629
00:36:52,679 --> 00:36:54,920
will wipe the slate clean with the past.

630
00:36:56,119 --> 00:36:57,360
What era does he think this is?

631
00:37:00,719 --> 00:37:01,760
What are you shouting about?

632
00:37:02,280 --> 00:37:03,559
Trying to show off how smart you are?

633
00:37:04,280 --> 00:37:05,000
Who are you talking to?

634
00:37:05,800 --> 00:37:06,960
I wasn't talking to you!

635
00:37:07,880 --> 00:37:08,679
All right, all right.

636
00:37:08,800 --> 00:37:09,400
Xiaoqin,

637
00:37:09,719 --> 00:37:10,719
stop cooking.

638
00:37:11,039 --> 00:37:12,360
You're filling the whole house with greasy smoke.

639
00:37:12,360 --> 00:37:13,360
Just hurry up and go home, go on.

640
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:14,800
It's driving me crazy.

641
00:37:15,599 --> 00:37:16,480
Dad,

642
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:18,719
what's gotten into you today?

643
00:37:18,960 --> 00:37:19,880
Let me tell you.

644
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:20,920
If he wants to leave,

645
00:37:20,960 --> 00:37:21,760
let him leave.

646
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:22,920
I'm not going anywhere.

647
00:37:23,760 --> 00:37:25,159
I've lived in Lacheng my entire life.

648
00:37:25,519 --> 00:37:26,039
When I die,

649
00:37:26,239 --> 00:37:27,440
I'm dying right here.

650
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:29,559
Nobody said they were leaving!

651
00:37:31,159 --> 00:37:33,119
You're getting senile yourself.

652
00:37:37,880 --> 00:37:38,400
Ali.

653
00:37:39,599 --> 00:37:40,199
Sit down.

654
00:37:42,840 --> 00:37:44,039
Getting senile, am I?

655
00:37:45,880 --> 00:37:46,480
Sit down.

656
00:37:47,199 --> 00:37:48,599
I told you to sit down, did you hear me?

657
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:50,119
Every single one of you...

658
00:37:51,440 --> 00:37:52,920
none of you gives me any peace!

659
00:37:55,280 --> 00:37:56,119
Dinner's ready.

660
00:37:56,559 --> 00:37:57,119
I'm not eating.

661
00:37:58,800 --> 00:37:59,880
I'm full enough on anger alone.

662
00:38:07,480 --> 00:38:07,920
Self-draw!

663
00:38:09,079 --> 00:38:09,480
Old Chen,

664
00:38:09,480 --> 00:38:10,679
you're really lucky today!

665
00:38:10,679 --> 00:38:11,280
Winning every single hand!

666
00:38:11,280 --> 00:38:13,679
A win off the kong, too!

667
00:38:13,760 --> 00:38:14,159
That's the max payout!

668
00:38:14,159 --> 00:38:14,639
You're raking it in every round!

669
00:38:14,639 --> 00:38:15,480
Come on, pay up!

670
00:38:15,880 --> 00:38:17,119
Drawing the bonus tile every time!

671
00:38:18,039 --> 00:38:19,159
Who ordered soda?

672
00:38:19,719 --> 00:38:20,480
Soda's here!

673
00:38:20,840 --> 00:38:21,280
Put it here.

674
00:38:22,639 --> 00:38:23,480
Listen up, everyone!

675
00:38:23,480 --> 00:38:25,440
The sodas are on me today!

676
00:38:27,039 --> 00:38:28,119
Great, great!

677
00:38:28,239 --> 00:38:28,800
How much?

678
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:29,360
Fifty-one.

679
00:38:29,400 --> 00:38:30,360
Just give me 50.

680
00:38:30,760 --> 00:38:31,599
Fifty, huh?

681
00:38:32,519 --> 00:38:33,039
Here.

682
00:38:35,159 --> 00:38:36,000
It's so filthy!

683
00:38:36,039 --> 00:38:36,840
Got a cleaner bill?

684
00:38:37,559 --> 00:38:39,400
Old or new, it spends the same, doesn't it?

685
00:38:39,880 --> 00:38:41,079
Fine, fine. This old man...

686
00:38:45,719 --> 00:38:46,360
Counterfeit!

687
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:47,119
It's fake, isn't it?

688
00:38:47,119 --> 00:38:48,159
You gave me fake money!

689
00:38:48,599 --> 00:38:49,360
What fake money?!

690
00:38:49,840 --> 00:38:51,159
You're claiming I gave you fake money?!

691
00:38:51,360 --> 00:38:52,119
What else is it, then?!

692
00:38:52,159 --> 00:38:52,880
Take a look, everyone!

693
00:38:52,920 --> 00:38:53,639
Is this fake or what?!

694
00:38:53,679 --> 00:38:54,239
Shunzi!

695
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:55,320
Show some respect!

696
00:38:55,559 --> 00:38:56,119
This is Chief Engineer Chen!

697
00:38:56,119 --> 00:38:56,920
Don't you know him?

698
00:38:57,079 --> 00:38:58,320
He used to be Chief Engineer.

699
00:38:58,360 --> 00:38:59,039
I'm laid off now!

700
00:38:59,039 --> 00:38:59,800
I don't care who he is!

701
00:39:00,679 --> 00:39:02,159
What nonsense are you spewing?!

702
00:39:02,400 --> 00:39:04,000
When have I ever spent fake money?!

703
00:39:04,480 --> 00:39:05,400
Trying to destroy the evidence?!

704
00:39:05,440 --> 00:39:06,079
Give it back! Back off!

705
00:39:06,079 --> 00:39:06,559
Stay away from me!

706
00:39:06,559 --> 00:39:08,039
You're picking a fight on purpose, aren't you?

707
00:39:08,119 --> 00:39:08,840
Don't put your hands on me!

708
00:39:08,840 --> 00:39:09,280
I'm warning you!

709
00:39:09,320 --> 00:39:10,159
I'll hit you!

710
00:39:10,159 --> 00:39:10,880
Go ahead, hit me! Hit me!

711
00:39:10,880 --> 00:39:11,400
I'll smack you!

712
00:39:11,480 --> 00:39:12,199
Take that!

713
00:39:14,239 --> 00:39:14,960
This punk...

714
00:39:15,119 --> 00:39:17,199
Chief Engineer is hitting him! Break it up!

715
00:39:17,199 --> 00:39:17,960
I saw the whole thing!

716
00:39:17,960 --> 00:39:18,840
Let me tell you,

717
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:19,760
I've got connections!

718
00:39:19,960 --> 00:39:21,119
I'm calling the police!

719
00:39:21,400 --> 00:39:22,119
- I'm calling the police!
- Go on, call them!

720
00:39:22,199 --> 00:39:23,199
Call them! Go ahead!

721
00:39:23,760 --> 00:39:25,440
Hello, Officer?

722
00:39:25,920 --> 00:39:27,599
It's Shunzi!

723
00:39:27,719 --> 00:39:29,519
Chen Qingchun beat me up!

724
00:39:31,360 --> 00:39:32,559
Keep talking! Go on!

725
00:39:33,119 --> 00:39:34,360
Weren't you calling the cops?

726
00:39:34,679 --> 00:39:36,519
Saying I spent counterfeit money!

727
00:39:37,760 --> 00:39:38,719
Tell the police!

728
00:39:38,800 --> 00:39:40,199
Tell them I print counterfeit bills!

729
00:39:44,119 --> 00:39:44,599
Look at you.

730
00:39:44,800 --> 00:39:45,920
I'm telling you, this spot is clean.

731
00:39:46,119 --> 00:39:46,960
Lie on the ground!

732
00:39:47,599 --> 00:39:48,840
Lie down and throw a tantrum!

733
00:39:50,679 --> 00:39:51,920
Why aren't you throwing a fit now?

734
00:39:54,400 --> 00:39:55,400
I barely did anything to him.

735
00:39:55,400 --> 00:39:56,519
I just tapped him lightly,

736
00:39:56,519 --> 00:39:59,079
and he threw himself down to play victim and call the cops!

737
00:40:00,280 --> 00:40:01,119
Unbelievable.

738
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:07,800
Chief Engineer Chen!

739
00:40:08,239 --> 00:40:09,280
What are you doing here?

740
00:40:10,639 --> 00:40:11,960
What a coincidence. What happened?

741
00:40:15,039 --> 00:40:15,960
Yeah, yeah.

742
00:40:20,639 --> 00:40:21,440
Just a small misunderstanding.

743
00:40:24,239 --> 00:40:24,840
Everything's fine, right?

744
00:40:24,920 --> 00:40:25,440
It's fine.

745
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:28,519
All right, since we ran into each other,

746
00:40:28,760 --> 00:40:29,519
let's find a room and chat.

747
00:40:30,880 --> 00:40:32,639
Mind if I borrow this guy for a bit?

748
00:40:32,840 --> 00:40:34,239
I'll explain everything to you later.

749
00:40:34,400 --> 00:40:34,800
Sure thing.

750
00:40:36,480 --> 00:40:37,000
Let's go.

751
00:40:53,000 --> 00:40:53,800
Wait here a moment.

752
00:40:57,239 --> 00:40:58,079
Over here. This way.

753
00:40:58,199 --> 00:40:59,000
This way, Chief Engineer Chen.

754
00:40:59,360 --> 00:40:59,719
Please.

755
00:41:01,000 --> 00:41:01,679
It's all right.

756
00:41:01,800 --> 00:41:02,480
It's no big deal.

757
00:41:02,559 --> 00:41:03,880
They'll sort it out right away.

758
00:41:05,039 --> 00:41:05,800
Have a seat, sit down.

759
00:41:06,360 --> 00:41:07,000
It's warm inside.

760
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:08,079
Take off your coat.

761
00:41:08,960 --> 00:41:09,480
Sure.

762
00:41:10,719 --> 00:41:11,880
No offense, but... Thanks.

763
00:41:12,280 --> 00:41:13,280
At your age,

764
00:41:13,280 --> 00:41:14,840
why get so worked up over a kid?

765
00:41:18,239 --> 00:41:19,800
He said the money I gave him

766
00:41:21,039 --> 00:41:21,840
was counterfeit.

767
00:41:22,480 --> 00:41:24,639
I mean, at my age,

768
00:41:25,679 --> 00:41:27,760
I'm an intellectual after all,

769
00:41:28,039 --> 00:41:29,400
honest and upright.

770
00:41:30,119 --> 00:41:32,079
Why would I ever use counterfeit money?

771
00:41:32,199 --> 00:41:32,719
I understand, of course.

772
00:41:32,760 --> 00:41:34,000
He definitely misunderstood you.

773
00:41:36,039 --> 00:41:37,039
Actually, the reason I came to see you today

774
00:41:37,079 --> 00:41:38,239
is mainly to ask about something.

775
00:41:38,719 --> 00:41:40,599
Your son, Chen Yuan,

776
00:41:40,960 --> 00:41:41,960
stole someone's tapes.

777
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:42,639
Did you know about that?

778
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:44,199
I...

779
00:41:47,840 --> 00:41:48,599
I didn't know.

780
00:41:49,079 --> 00:41:49,519
I have no idea.

781
00:41:50,679 --> 00:41:52,440
He broke into Shen Leshui's place

782
00:41:53,119 --> 00:41:54,559
and took the footage she shot of you

783
00:41:54,559 --> 00:41:56,800
and the other veteran workers for that documentary—

784
00:41:57,119 --> 00:41:58,960
all that discarded footage, he stole it.

785
00:41:59,280 --> 00:42:00,360
And after stealing it,

786
00:42:00,360 --> 00:42:02,000
he erased a lot of the content.

787
00:42:02,840 --> 00:42:03,559
What content?

788
00:42:04,719 --> 00:42:05,400
Funny thing is,

789
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:07,840
when we verified it later,

790
00:42:07,880 --> 00:42:09,119
the parts he erased

791
00:42:09,239 --> 00:42:10,199
all had to do with you.

792
00:42:11,199 --> 00:42:11,760
Me?

793
00:42:13,920 --> 00:42:15,800
On the last day of 1999,

794
00:42:16,679 --> 00:42:18,639
Ma Guowen used an excuse

795
00:42:18,639 --> 00:42:19,760
about a burglary at the brewery, right?

796
00:42:19,840 --> 00:42:20,840
The truth is, it was just

797
00:42:20,840 --> 00:42:22,360
to keep the workers trapped inside,

798
00:42:22,360 --> 00:42:23,599
so they couldn't attend the auction.

799
00:42:23,760 --> 00:42:24,599
You knew about that.

800
00:42:25,199 --> 00:42:25,639
I did.

801
00:42:26,280 --> 00:42:27,920
Then why did you disappear that day?

802
00:42:28,719 --> 00:42:29,239
I...

803
00:42:30,159 --> 00:42:31,119
I was at the brewery!

804
00:42:31,360 --> 00:42:33,119
I was right there with everyone!

805
00:42:33,960 --> 00:42:35,280
Except that...

806
00:42:35,679 --> 00:42:38,159
I stepped away once to use the restroom.

807
00:42:39,440 --> 00:42:40,800
That was the only time I was gone.

808
00:42:40,800 --> 00:42:42,239
So they couldn't film you while you were away,

809
00:42:42,519 --> 00:42:43,039
right?

810
00:42:44,239 --> 00:42:45,239
Well, look at Chief Engineer Chen.

811
00:42:45,599 --> 00:42:46,639
What a memory!

812
00:42:46,840 --> 00:42:47,880
Back in '99,

813
00:42:48,400 --> 00:42:50,159
and he still remembers a bathroom break.

814
00:42:50,519 --> 00:42:51,679
Write that down, note it down.

815
00:42:55,599 --> 00:42:56,039
Engineer Chen.

816
00:42:57,360 --> 00:42:58,599
You were the traitor back then, weren't you?

817
00:43:00,239 --> 00:43:01,199
You're the traitor!

818
00:43:01,480 --> 00:43:02,440
Go ask around!

819
00:43:03,360 --> 00:43:05,639
I was the brewery's Chief Engineer,

820
00:43:05,960 --> 00:43:06,960
a model worker!

821
00:43:07,039 --> 00:43:08,000
You can check for yourself!

822
00:43:08,599 --> 00:43:09,719
Where were you the day Cao Jun died?

823
00:43:10,039 --> 00:43:10,679
Cao Jun?

824
00:43:16,480 --> 00:43:17,639
I was at my son's place.

825
00:43:19,760 --> 00:43:20,840
I had a few drinks,

826
00:43:21,079 --> 00:43:22,079
took a nap,

827
00:43:22,960 --> 00:43:24,599
and drove home later.

828
00:43:25,719 --> 00:43:27,599
But as I passed the brewery gate,

829
00:43:28,960 --> 00:43:30,039
I crashed into that sculpture.

830
00:43:31,199 --> 00:43:32,760
Then... then I went to

831
00:43:34,159 --> 00:43:34,840
the traffic police.

832
00:43:35,199 --> 00:43:35,920
It was all settled.

833
00:43:36,159 --> 00:43:36,519
Right.

834
00:43:37,840 --> 00:43:39,719
I still... I still have the ticket right here.

835
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:41,719
Take a look yourself.

836
00:43:56,199 --> 00:43:57,880
You remember taking a piss back in '99,

837
00:43:57,880 --> 00:43:59,199
but forgot how the car crash happened?

838
00:44:01,239 --> 00:44:02,960
I found a piece of car debris.

839
00:44:04,119 --> 00:44:05,559
But this is silver.

840
00:44:06,159 --> 00:44:07,880
Chen Qingchun's car was black, wasn't it?

841
00:44:08,400 --> 00:44:09,639
Why did you go

842
00:44:10,480 --> 00:44:12,440
to the traffic police to take the fall for me?

843
00:44:12,679 --> 00:44:14,000
Don't think I don't know

844
00:44:16,880 --> 00:44:18,079
what you did.
